  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped carrots, celery, and boiled potatoes. Cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the chopped parsley, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the paprika, cumin, coriander, and chopped green chilies. Stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional chopped parsley if desired.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as necessary.",
    "Serve immediately, and enjoy!",
